{
    "word": "intemperance",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d4d0eba0-0725-3cee-a328-b6ebbe7427da",
                "word": "intemperance",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a33d7bb7-acc7-47b6-9a97-7747edf2abea",
                        "entry_id": "d4d0eba0-0725-3cee-a328-b6ebbe7427da",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "intemperances"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9739bd2d-82be-3e24-b9da-e3ec07b40ac0",
                        "entry_id": "d4d0eba0-0725-3cee-a328-b6ebbe7427da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lack of moderation or temperance; excess."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0ff4b86-6417-48d9-9ca6-d9f10d1c1e58",
                                "sense_id": "9739bd2d-82be-3e24-b9da-e3ec07b40ac0",
                                "text": "They deserved the enmity of the Pagans; and some of them might deserve the reproaches of avarice and intemperance; of avarice, which they gratified with holy plunder, and of intemperance, which they indulged at the expense of the people, who foolishly admired their tattered garments, loud psalmody, and artificial paleness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae0a6d9d-c1af-4695-860d-4e9dd045a50a",
                                "sense_id": "9739bd2d-82be-3e24-b9da-e3ec07b40ac0",
                                "text": "Raffles proved more unmanageable than he had shown himself to be in his former appearances, his chronic state of mental restlessness, the growing effect of habitual intemperance, quickly shaking off every impression from what was said to him."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12637207-a1cd-3c47-a505-51d5e0988dba",
                        "entry_id": "d4d0eba0-0725-3cee-a328-b6ebbe7427da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Drunkenness or gluttony."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8c0be40-3ef2-4ee1-8293-b437d55de7af",
                                "sense_id": "12637207-a1cd-3c47-a505-51d5e0988dba",
                                "text": "As I supported him towards his lodgings I could see that he was not only suffering from the effects of a recent debauch, but that a long course of intemperance had affected his nerves and his brain. […] He rambled in his speech, too, in a manner which suggested the delirium of disease rather than the talk of a drunkard."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "50375d9b-4ce3-4bfa-b961-c3d0b4e81ec3",
                                "sense_id": "12637207-a1cd-3c47-a505-51d5e0988dba",
                                "text": "How can we marvel that the constitution thus disposed to intemperance finds the stimulus of drink indispensable?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d982dc6-aae0-4729-9f6d-aba9fb7e7755",
                        "source_entry_id": "d4d0eba0-0725-3cee-a328-b6ebbe7427da",
                        "source_sense_description": "lack of moderation",
                        "target_lang_word": "intempérance",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "intempérance",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "692477cd-0b41-3fb0-bc62-f7bfe11f1f19",
                                        "entry_id": "dc6ec8c9-28c0-3889-bb4e-76269864618c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Manque de tempérance, de sobriété."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46709d1e-6641-4c2f-8530-8d16075c5cb1",
                                                "sense_id": "692477cd-0b41-3fb0-bc62-f7bfe11f1f19",
                                                "text": "L'art de faire subsister ensemble l'intempérance et la santé est un art aussi chimérique que la pierre philosophale, l'astrologie judiciaire et la théologie des mages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8261c207-6b0a-4556-848f-c7c31a9ceac4",
                                                "sense_id": "692477cd-0b41-3fb0-bc62-f7bfe11f1f19",
                                                "text": "À cette époque d’unanimité, la réalité était dominée par la Sainte Trinité. Nous avions un choix de trois en tout. […] Trois sortes de péchés en chaire : le blasphème, l’intempérance et la luxure; trois catégories de péchés que les prédicateurs traduisaient plus familièrement par la sacrure, la champlure et la créature. Pendant la retraite du carême des hommes, on laissait tomber les fioritures pour aller droit au fait : les péchés secs, les péchés mouillés et les péchés poilus."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90cb166d-eb39-37ce-8fe5-974ec5e458a2",
                                        "entry_id": "dc6ec8c9-28c0-3889-bb4e-76269864618c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abus d’alcool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac74c5e2-c2c9-48c1-a960-59f4cebbef1c",
                                                "sense_id": "90cb166d-eb39-37ce-8fe5-974ec5e458a2",
                                                "text": "Et puis, nous en rapportant à Jullian, nous avions conclu avec tristesse que, déjà, l’intempérance des Gaulois avait fait perdre à ces guerriers indomptables l’empire du monde d’abord, leur indépendance ensuite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "841ecc93-a1eb-44b1-a80d-4114d781da88",
                                                "sense_id": "90cb166d-eb39-37ce-8fe5-974ec5e458a2",
                                                "text": "Voyez comme son intempérance le rend vulnérable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96639eac-31f0-37f4-b5a0-bb6663d7fd63",
                                        "entry_id": "dc6ec8c9-28c0-3889-bb4e-76269864618c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excès."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe8ed23a-47a4-408d-b379-54dea9f15d81",
                                                "sense_id": "96639eac-31f0-37f4-b5a0-bb6663d7fd63",
                                                "text": "Intempérance de travail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "312c4bb0-48b9-4241-9914-0d7d273b5856",
                                                "sense_id": "96639eac-31f0-37f4-b5a0-bb6663d7fd63",
                                                "text": "Intempérance de plume."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0d76096-a9a3-43bd-aec7-f42a6224b93c",
                                                "sense_id": "96639eac-31f0-37f4-b5a0-bb6663d7fd63",
                                                "text": "Intempérance de langue : Trop grande liberté qu’on se donne en écrivant ou en parlant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fc39a5d9-2c6a-47d8-b7e2-d631bab583bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "d4d0eba0-0725-3cee-a328-b6ebbe7427da",
                        "source_sense_description": "lack of moderation",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zügellosigkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zügellosigkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e423a6c-c22b-32a0-8d62-2111249a1ccf",
                                        "entry_id": "4a8b30d5-605e-3341-9c28-ec440b2810ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Haltung/Verhalten, die von keinen moralischen, rechtlichen oder sonstigen, allgemein akzeptierten Prinzipien kontrolliert werden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f89e9d3e-02fa-4593-805c-700c8ee6f9d4",
                                                "sense_id": "9e423a6c-c22b-32a0-8d62-2111249a1ccf",
                                                "text": "„Jedes Mal, wenn so eine Druckwelle der Sittlichkeit stoßweise das Land erschütterte, ging es auch der Rockmusik an den Kragen, die sich ohnehin von Natur aus verdächtig machte, Unmoral, Zügellosigkeit und Sittenverfall Vorschub zu leisten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "919b4ddf-4748-4fce-a236-2294888f9c03",
                                                "sense_id": "9e423a6c-c22b-32a0-8d62-2111249a1ccf",
                                                "text": "„Auch grundsätzliche Zügellosigkeit entspricht nicht ihrem Naturell.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f27e90e-58c6-480e-a7eb-dbc810e23234",
                                                "sense_id": "9e423a6c-c22b-32a0-8d62-2111249a1ccf",
                                                "text": "„Trotz dieser Verbote, ja gerade wegen dieser Verbote, herrscht in Madrid eine jedes Maß überschreitende Zügellosigkeit.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
